, "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "为什么有感而发\n是因为我刚要ai跑了一遍最近有机会的项目\n然后发现一大半项目都是二次创业😂 https://t.co/5f6RfBqT34", "url": "https://x.com/AirdropAlchemis/status/2112087758668001405"}, {"author_id": "1484231561784737792", "created_at": "2026-10-19T07:42:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112087077127131151"], "id": "2112087077127131151", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1665, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "我觉得是否参与一个项目的很关键的因素是研究这个项目团队是否为二次创业，而且要挖出来团队过往项目的情况，是否有格局，还是rug了。\n\n过往成功过的项目，从资源实力角度来看，更容易成功\n同理，垃圾向来是垃圾\n江山易改，本性难移", "url": "https://x.com/AirdropAlchemis/status/2112087077127131151"}, {"author_id": "1484231561784737792", "created_at": "2026-10-19T07:29:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112083716755587413"], "id": "2112083716755587413", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 4398, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 10, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "如果你长期用GPT\n打开设置记忆中的【记忆摘要】\n你会感觉到恐惧。 https://t.co/0NP6v23gye", "url": "https://x.com/AirdropAlchemis/status/2112083716755587413"}, {"author_id": "1484231561784737792", "created_at": "2026-10-19T07:04:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112077375492255819"], "id": "2112077375492255819", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 6621, "like_count": 243, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 240, "retweet_count": 151}, "text": "你们真的喜欢OKX迈凯轮F1乐高模型吗？？  \n\n我买3台送给大家好了啊\n一键三连留个言就好了啊\n明天开\n\n就喜欢撒周边让大家开心\n赶紧一起度过熊市吧🥹 https://t.co/DqHLSUQF5B", "url": "https://x.com/AirdropAlchemis/status/2112077375492255819"}, {"author_id": "1484231561784737792", "created_at": "2026-10-19T06:54:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112074795739431037"], "id": "2112074795739431037", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 2081, "like_count": 13, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 8, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "愚蠢的行情、过度拥挤的二级市场让一级撸毛项目都没啥生存空间了，但叔依旧每周一让Codex自动收集最近完成融资且有参与机会的项目\n\n这周筛选出来的项目是--Spout\n\n项